  "_comment": "The reverse edge RS-P3 buys (§4.1, 'Formspec Need identity'): a policy-corpus assertion citing a product Need as its evidence subject, which is the direction Formspec cannot reach from its own side. The `@2` suffix pins the Need revision this citation saw, and the scheme tag is what makes the identifier an edition rather than the live Needs Document URL."
